window.products.push({"id":1177014,"name":"Antop AT-307 4K HDTV Antenna","category":"electronics","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51cY4ifHoHL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"ANTOP Ring Indoor HDTV Antenna with Gain Attenuator, AT-307 The ANTOP Ring Indoor HDTV Antenna, AT-307 with classical design in piano white is aesthetically pleasing and suitable to match a wide range of home décor styles. The AT-307 supports HDTV, 1080P TV and 4K ULTRA HD,and is compatible with TV converter boxes or digital TVs.  The number of TV channels and programs that you can receive for FREE depends on the amount of over-the-air broadcasters in your area. With the ANTOP AT-307, there is no monthly fee and no need to subscribe. Just plug into a TV, scan the channels, then enjoy your TV shows!  By following the simple tips below, you can enjoy FREE TV with you ANTOP Antenna:  - Rotate or turn the loop for the best UHF reception.  - Adjust and turn the extendable telescopic antennas for the best VHF reception.  - Adjust the gain attenuator for fine-tune the reception.  - Scan channels monthly to find all available channels including newly added or changed.  - Do not place or hide the antenna in/behind any metallic objects.  - Install the antenna as high as possible and near a window for better reception.  - Keep the antenna away from any high power consumption devices to avoid interference. Product Information Range: 35 miles from point of signal origination Reception Pattern: Multi-directional  Polarization: Horizontal / Vertical  Color: Piano White Size: 9.45x5.90x8.86in Coaxial Cable: 6ft Integrated What’s in the box AT-307 RING Digital Indoor HDTV Antenna 6ft Coaxial Cable Instruction/User Manual","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51cY4ifHoHL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ANTOP Antenna","source_asin":"B01DVSHYLK","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1177014","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01DVSHYLK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B01DVSHYLK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
