window.products.push({"id":1177136,"name":"CableWholesale Cat6 Ethernet Cable, 24AWG, RJ45 Gold Plate Connector, ETL, 4 Pair Stranded Copper, Snagless Boot Unshielded Twisted Pair (UTP) Interne","category":"electronics","retail price":16.17,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61bziy7uTeL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"WIDE USAGE: These cables will suffice for connecting routers/switches to Cable/DSL modems, computers to routers/switches or even in the server/network room for connecting ports on patch panels. These Ethernet Cables are great for the home office or any other environment. Cat6 cables are used for networking, data transfer, and phone lines. Cat6 Cable is used in network applications and has been designed specifically for Gigabit Ethernet applications. PREMIUM QUALITY: STP (Shielded Twisted Pair) Snagless, booted patch cable with RJ45 connector and clip. The cable is wrapped around Aluminum Foil/Mylar for extra protection with Tinned Copper drain wire. The individual conductors are 24 AWG (American wire gauge) stranded pure copper. The connectors are wired to the T568B standard. Cat5e patch cables are stranded to improve flexibility. Pure copper conductors provide the best signal possible. UNIVERSAL COMPLIANCE WITH WIDE COLOR RANGE: Our Cat6 Ethernet patch cables exceed the EIA/TIA-568-C standard, Power over Ethernet (PoE), Voice over IP (VoIP) and ROHS Compliant. It is ETL Verified, UL/CSA approved and pre-terminated with RJ45 connectors. It is available in a wide variety of colors for proper color coding. FUTURE-PROOF SPEED AND CONNECTIVITY: This cable provides exceptional transmission performance and low signal losses. It supports up to 350 Mhz (cat5e) is suitable for Fast Ethernet, Gigabit Ethernet, and 10-Gigabit Ethernet. LIFETIME WARRANTY: We are proud to offer lifetime warranty on our cables, adaptors and on most of our products.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61bziy7uTeL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CableWholesale","source_asin":"B00QLY6J6I","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1177136","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00QLY6J6I","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B00QLY6J6I","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
