window.products.push({"id":1177166,"name":"Sony DSC-S30 Cyber-shot 1.2MP Digital Camera with 3x Optical Zoom","category":"electronics","retail price":47.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61uRKjTD09L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product description *1.3 megapixels, 6x zoom. Free angle LCD. Includes USB, CD and battery kit. In original box. Amazon.com The DSC-S30 is Sony's entry-level Cyber-shot camera. Like all of the Cyber-shots, it uses a long-life InfoLithium battery for power and stores images on memory sticks. The camera's CCD sensor has a resolution of 1.3 megapixels (for 1,280 x 960 images), and built-in software interpolation can be used to boost the image to 1.6 megapixels. Instead of looking through a traditional optical viewfinder, users compose images by watching the 2-inch LCD display. The display's unusual flip-and-swivel design lets you preview self-portraits and protects the LCD when the camera isn't in use. Other useful features include a 3x optical/2x digital zoom lens with macro mode, USB image transfer, aperture priority and shutter priority modes, and video output.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61uRKjTD09L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Sony","source_asin":"B00004UDQ3","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1177166","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00004UDQ3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B00004UDQ3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1177167,"name":"Wireless Earbud, Sport Bluetoth Headphones 5.1 with HiFi Stereo, Wireless Earphones with Earhooks, in Ear Noise Cancelling Earbud with HD Mic, IP7 Wat","category":"electronics","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71MIJKAGJsL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"One Step Pairing and 40Hrs Playtime: Pick up 2 earbud bluetooth from charging case, they will automatically pair with your smart device after first time connected. Rid of cord, enjoy true wireless.It only takes a few seconds to enter the world of melodious music. Bluetooth earbuds with microphone uses low power design Type-C charging case. Up to 6-8 hours playtime of normal usage on a single charge and boost that to 40 hours playtime with the 400mah compact charging case. Comfortable Earhook Design For Sports : New sport earphone bluetooth wireless to keep you motivated, adjustable and secure-fit silicone earhooks and ergonomic design ensure your sport earbud stay comfortably firm in place when doing sports, running and other outside activity etc, do not worry about the earphones will fall off. Equipped with 3 pairs of spare ear caps (L/M/S) for your choice to get the most suitable feeling. So that you will not feel tired and pain when wearing it for a long time. Superior Hi-Fi Stereo Sound Quality: Face of one pair of Hi-Fi wireless earbud bluetooth, heard the backdrop of real, rich bass, tenor out so melodious, exquisitely carved treble then so ethereal and elegant. Latest cvc8.0 noise cancellation technology provides a balanced and natural sound, and noise cancelling earbud can provide you with clear call experience with no audio dropouts and interruptions. So you can focus more on the music you love and concentrate on work. Bluetooth 5.1 and Wide Compatibility: Bluetooth earphones adopt the latest bluetooth 5.1 chip and technology, which can offer a clearer, faster, and smoother connection. This wireless headphones is compatible with smart phones that use iOS 9.0/Android 5.0 or above, and Bluetooth 4.0 or above all bluetooth devices, such like mobile phones, tablets, PC, laptop, etc. IP7 Waterproof and Smart Touch Control: This running earbud wireless is constructed with Ip7 waterproof standard, can easily resist sweat and rain, and you don’t have to worry even if it rains. You can enjoy high-quality music anytime, anywhere in the gym, running, and daily exercise. With a touch control technology and high sensitivity touch sensor, you can answer calls,hang up, play / pause music, adjust volume, switch songs and activate siri with just a touch of your true wireless earbud.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71MIJKAGJsL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Rulefiss","source_asin":"B09GK5B1W2","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1177167","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09GK5B1W2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B09GK5B1W2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
