window.products.push({"id":1177172,"name":"STM Velo 2 Messenger Bag with Side Entry Laptop Compartment and Integrated iPad/Tablet Pocket","category":"electronics","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51X-MOSi0sL._AC_.jpg","description":"The STM Velo 2 is a thoughtful redesign of the popular namesake STM messenger-style laptop bag. As with the original, the Velo 2 offers a unique side-entry padded laptop compartment for stealthy access to your computer. The roomy main compartment includes a soft-lined pocket for a tablet and can be zipped together with the upper cover flap for extra security. The lower flap can either be secured with buckles for transport or left open for unrestricted access to the front organizational pockets. A handy, soft-lined, zippered drop pocket on the top of the bag is the perfect spot for your phone or sunglasses. Generously-sized side zipper pockets can swallow a water bottle or umbrella. The versatile STM Velo 2 offers several carry modes: briefcase style with the top carry handle, shoulder style (shoulder strap is removable), messenger bike style (includes an adjustable waist strap), or zip open the rear panel to slip the Velo 2 over the handle of your rolling luggage. A bike light attachment loop and reflective hits round out the design features. Rugged 300D polyester exterior will take a beating and STM’s limited lifetime warranty backs it up. Available in Small or Medium to accommodate 13” or 15” laptops.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51X-MOSi0sL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"STM","source_asin":"B00BHHBPUY","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1177172","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00BHHBPUY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B00BHHBPUY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
