window.products.push({"id":1177227,"name":"Poly - Voyager 4310 UC Wireless Headset + Charge Stand (Plantronics) - Single-Ear Headset- Connect to PC/Mac via USB-A Bluetooth Adapter, Cell Phone v","category":"electronics","retail price":136.32,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71QhDn9hK+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Free yourself from your desk with the perfect affordable Bluetooth wireless single-ear (mono) headset. Meet the Voyager 4310 UC. It’s everything you need to stay connected to all your devices whether at home or in the office. Keep yourself productive with all day comfort and dual-mic Acoustic Fence technology that eliminates background noise. Connect to a computer with the included BT700 USB-A adapter and to a mobile via Bluetooth v5.2. Keep your headset fully charged at all times using the included desktop charging stand. Microsoft Teams version supports easy collaboration with a dedicated Teams button for instant access to the Teams App. Phenomenal flexibility, connectivity and freedom? Yes please!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71QhDn9hK+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Plantronics","source_asin":"B0BFMKWNZ5","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1177227","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BFMKWNZ5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BFMKWNZ5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1177228,"name":"SB7T Spirit Box Paranormal Research Device with Ghost Augustine Flashlight","category":"electronics","retail price":94.9,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61J9xAS9djL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This is a must have item for anyone interested in ghost hunting. This is latest version of the famed SB7, the P-SB7T Rev 6, released 2023. It has the added function of ATDD (Automatic Temperature Deviation Detection), built in flashlight and a wrist strap. The internal speaker has been adjusted so that an external speaker no longer has to be connected. The background light is now red so it is night vision friendly. The new Multi-Function Display shows temperature changes from the intitial environmental temperature that you calibrate the Spirit Box to, along with which scanning speed you have chosen and the band frequency. You can change the screen to show ambient temperature instead of showing the ATDD (Auto Temp Deviation Detection). No need anymore to interrupt the EVP session and stop the scanning to change volume. And no ATDD sound alerts anymore that interfere with EVP sessions.The SB7 has been used on numerous paranormal TV shows giving proof that it can instantly transmit possible spirit voices. These EVPs (Electronic Voice Phenomena), typically express intelligence since they often call out things that identifies people present at the investigation or something that pertains to the investigation. Also, communications coming across typically co-relates to the known facts about that haunted site, such as specifics about the spirits there. The P-SB7 works by scanning the FM band and AM band along with a unique high frequency synthetic noise, a.k.a. white noise, where spirit voices seemingly are able to form words. The P-SB brand's FM band scans from 87.5 MHz to 108 MHz. Research has shown that is the most EVP active range and hence the SB7 focuses on that range. One can choose from 7 different millisecond sweep speeds. It's a matter of personal taste - how fast or slow one prefers the sweep to be set at. One can also sweep forward or backwards.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61J9xAS9djL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"P-SB7 & GhoSt Augustine","source_asin":"B06XT5XXWL","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1177228","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B06XT5XXWL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B06XT5XXWL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
