window.products.push({"id":1177355,"name":"7\" Wired Reverse Rear View Backup Camera System,Guide line,IP69K No Water Leakage Camera, Night Vision, Vibration-Proof 10G for Tractor/Truck/RV/Excav","category":"electronics","retail price":169.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/617rHAbABRL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","description":"【APPLICATIONS】This is an upgraded industrial grade wired one camera system. For its high vibration resisance ability of 10G and wide power input range DC12-24V, it is suitable for large vehicles, such as buses, box trucks, pickup trucks, garbage trucks, flatbed trucks, dump trucks, street sweeper trucks, refrigerator trucks, motor homes, vans, skid steers, farm tractors, combines, cotton pickers, crop sprayers, bulldozers, snow plows, forklifts, excavators, heavy equipments,etc. 【MONITOR】7”TFT LCD color monitor with U-type metal bracket and with 800RGB x480 resolution.It is not waterproof. It is compatible with most of the vehicles with a free power input range DC12-24V and supports with max 2 cameras. TVS device is built in to protect the monitor from being damaged by the transient high power of vehicles. And this monitor only supplies camera which is in use with DC12V, it saves energy. It is compatible with PAL/NTSC/AUTO. 【HEAVY DUTY CAMERA】It is color CCD Sharp 480tvls, provides super clear and real color image. The viewing angle is 120 degree. With waterproof rating IP69K(the highest level), with night vision. So it works perfectly in kinds of weathers. With Heavy duty, 10G vibration-proof rating, it works well with the vehicle which has intensive vibration in extreme conditions. 【Unique Selling Proposition】①.The monitor has DAY/NIGHT modes for option by menu to lighten the screen at day time and darken at night, not glare. ②.Monitor has a built-in protector for protecting monitor from being damaged by power polarities reversed. ③With built-in innovative system previous option settings memory even after it's turned off. ④.Camera's image can be set as mirror, non-mirror or up-side-down by OSD menu. ⑤Distance grid line can be turned on or off by OSD menu. 【Unique Selling Proposition】①Monitor has one trigger wire. Monitor will be triggered to be turned on automatically to display camera image when reversing. After reversing, the monitor will be back to the pervious mode. ②This system has two viewing options(view when reverse or remain on continuously). ③We uses waterproof Aviation 4-pin screw connectors, NO BNC/RCA. ④Easy to install. ⑤Two-year warranty and life-time tech support.⑥Contact us to tell us your needs, we can customize a kit for you. FAQs:1. Why buttons not work? ---Disconnect the trigger wire, it will work. Trigger wire needs to be connected to power of rear lamp. 2. Remote not work. ---Remote doesn't have battery,because it is forbidden by shipping.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/617rHAbABRL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ATPTK","source_asin":"B0829YNVTK","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1177355","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0829YNVTK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B0829YNVTK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
