window.products.push({"id":1177513,"name":"Portable Rechargeable FM Radio Headphones Bluetooth Earmuffs, Transistor Radios with Best Reception, Wireless Radio Headset Built-in Mic, Support TF C","category":"electronics","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51f+UuOlDuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Best Reception Personal FM Radio】A6 Headphones with radio bulilt in has crystal clear reception that allows you to enjoy FM music, News, Morning talks shows, sports games, NPR etcs. at home or doing outside activities. It's a nice walkman radio for jogging, hiking, cycling,camping... 【Bluetooth 5.0/TF Card/AUX Capabilities】For Wireless, A6 headphones with Bluetooth 5.0 is easy to connect your BT devices and the bulit in Mic is available for hands-free callings. You can also insert a TF Card to enjoy music which you have collected. For wired, it comes with AUX capabilities, perfect for using on your computer,cellphone or MP3. 【Rechargeable Lithium Battery】It's operated by built-in rechargeable lithium battery (600mAh), which runs up to 24 hours for a single charge. The headset will be full charged in about 2.5 hours. Say goodbye to expensive AA or AAA batteries forever,it is more cost-effective in daily use. 【Compact /High Comfort/Easy to Use】Foldable and light weight makes it easier to carry. Soft memory foam and adjustable headband can perfectly fit your heads, you will feel comfortable even for a long time. Large earmuffs can block out outside noises, good for yard work, mowing or in a nosiy environment. Controls are easy and intuitive, friendly for old timers or kids. It is an ideal gifts for the one who you care. 【Preset Favorite Channel】You can use the M button to save your favorite preset FM station on this transistor radio, then you can one-click quick access to enjoy the program whenever you are. The memory feature also can be used to save an emergency channel.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51f+UuOlDuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"UMUTOO","source_asin":"B0B7QSB46X","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1177513","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B7QSB46X","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B7QSB46X","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
