window.products.push({"id":1177608,"name":"eTauro 6-Outlet Music Synchronized Power Strip (Dual Purpose Power Outlet)","category":"electronics","retail price":69.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81m9sOyUDPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Excite your sight and sound sensors for music. A totally new concept. 1) No longer to buy expensive lights sequencer and spend long hours tweaking the DMX program for limited songs.   2) Perfect for Cinco De Mayo, July4, Halloween, Christmas, and your parties.   3) Turn your basement into a Men's Cave, or dance hall. Play your favorite music and plug into this device to operate all kinds of lights.  4) Hookup your favorite speakers to produce high fidelity music. Truly one of a kind Musical Power Strip product. Beneath the heavy black alloy metallic case of a power strip, it is a musical sound transformer. In its normal usage, it is a power strip you use everyday for power distribution up to SIX outlets. Three Permanent and three Switchable . BUT when it is not doing its regular job.... It transforms your favorite music into three different frequency bands (High, Mid, Low) and modulate the power signals out of three different switchable outlets. Toggle to switch position II will let music to modulate the switchable outlets. This may sound too technical. To put it in simpler terms, this device can can sync your light decorations with any of your favorite tunes. Play, \"Jungle Bell\", \"Grandma run over by Reindeer\", and so on... In fact, it can sync up to unlimited music and even your own voice. Use it not only for Christmas. Think about your birthday party, Cinco De Mayo, wedding party, Halloween party, or just for a family Karaoke night.... Transform your favorite music into multitude of lights that fills the party room. Decorate your party with sound and light to create the atmosphere without complicated programming skill. This is a Plug and Play device suitable for any parties, shows, Karaoke,..Connect your speakers. Plug in your CD player, FM radio, or using a Bluetooth Dongle to sync music from your cell phone. Plug in the music source and instantly reveal the magic of the device.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81m9sOyUDPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"eTauro","source_asin":"B077XXWZKG","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1177608","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B077XXWZKG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B077XXWZKG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
