window.products.push({"id":1177668,"name":"SUPNICE Kids Case for iPad 10.2 inch, iPad 9th/8th/7th 2021/2020/2019 Generation Case with Built-in Screen Protector, Durable Shockproof Lightweight H","category":"electronics","retail price":15.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71pLT8lqwKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"➤【Compatibility Model】Designed exclusively for iPad 9th generation 2021, iPad 8th generation (Model: A2428, A2429, A2430, A2270) ,ipad 7th Generation 10.2 (Model: A2197/A2198/A2200). Note: DO NOT fit other Tablet ➤【Shock Proof】Made with kid-friendly, anti-slip and shock absorbing EVA flexible foam, lightweight but super sturdy, no need to worry your kids will be rough with the iPad, it will provide full-body protection of your iPad against accidental drops, scratches, shocks, bumps and dirt. ➤【Screen Protector】 iPad 10.2 case with built-in crystal-clear, fully integrated screen protector keeps your iPad from scratches and drops. ➤【Built-in Kickstand】Foldable Kickstand Brings Multiple viewing and typing positions,the stand on the back gives it strong support and frees your hands, making your life easy and convenient. ➤【Friendly to kids】iPad 10.2 case comes with top handle which makes it easy for little hands carry around, the color is bright, touch is soft, a great gift to those family with babies, kids, even grow-ups.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71pLT8lqwKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SUPNICE","source_asin":"B09GK7VL8D","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1177668","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09GK7VL8D","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B09GK7VL8D","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1177669,"name":"Alphacool Eiszyklon Aurora LUX PRO 140mm Fan, Digital RGB","category":"electronics","retail price":20.75,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/613NUA3VHOL._SL1200_.jpg","description":"You may have already seen the Alphacool Eiszyklon Aurora LUX Pro fan on the Alphacool Eisbaer Aurora series. It offers a wide control range as well as outstanding digital RGB LED lighting. The individually controllable 5V aRGB LEDs paired with the special design of the fan frame create unique effects.Ingenious LightingThe frame is equipped with digital addressable 5V RGB LEDs which illuminate the whole frame. The frame is not completely transparent, but the illumination is done through narrow slits in four places. On the upper side there are two rows of these slits. Each narrow frame runs along the inside and outside of the frame. This creates a unique illumination which looks very noble. Thanks to the recessed light diffusers the light is distributed evenly. This means that Individual LEDs are no longer visible.Wide Control Range and SilentThe fan can be controlled via the 4-pin PWM connector between 600 and 1500rpm. At 600 rpm the fan is almost silent, but still of-fers a good airflow rate as well as a high static pressure. Therefore, the fan can also be used very well on radiators for a water cooling system. Thanks to the high airflow, the fan is also ideal for ventilating a case. Decouplers are also found directly on the frame. The soft foam padding reduces the transmission of vibrations to the case. A further plus point for the silent capability of the fan.Connections?The fan is controlled via a 4-pin PWM connector. The cable is 50 cm long. This allows the fan to be connected to the mainboard or a special controller without any additional adapter cables or extensions. The digital aRGB LED lighting is controlled via a JST 3-pin connector.Tecinal data:Size: 140 x 140 x 25 mmSpeed: 600-1500 rpmStatic pressure: 1,6 mm H2OAir flow: 71 m³/hBearing: HydraulicFan connector: 4-Pin PWMRGB connector: 3-Pin JST + 3-Pin 5VLEDs: Adressable 5V Digital RGB LEDsPower consumption: 2 WNoise: 12-38 dB(A)MTBF: 50.000 hDownload data sheet PDF:Alphacool E","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/613NUA3VHOL._SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Alphacool","source_asin":"B07XZ9J5V7","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1177669","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07XZ9J5V7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B07XZ9J5V7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
