window.products.push({"id":1177710,"name":"Right Angle USB4 Extension Cable, 40Gbps & 100W 90 Degree Type C 4.0 Extender Cord, Thunderbolt 3/4 Extension Cable, Support 8K/6K@60Hz or Dual 4K Vid","category":"electronics","retail price":24.89,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71i+xFcxxxL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Exclusive 90 Degree USB4 Extender】 The USB4 extension cable is fully compliant with USB4 specifications that can support all USB C devices. The special 90° connector design is perfect for your Thunderbolt Laptop, Thunderbolt 3 monitor near the wall, or any Thunderbolt 3 & 4 cables in tight spaces, preventing scratches on the surface of Thunderbolt 3 & 4 docking stations. 【40Gbps Sync & 100W PD Charging】 This USB 4.0 extender cable supports an amazing speed of max 40Gbps to transfer data , it can copy 14 hours of high-definition video or 25,000 photos in 1 minute. And safely provide up to 100W (20V 5A) of power and charge to your Thunderbolt 3 device without an additional power supply. Note: The actual transmission speed and charging rate needs to refer to the devices used. 【Up to 8K UHD Display】 Just plug and play, you can drive single monitor at 8K/6K/5K@60Hz or dual monitors simultaneously at 4K@60Hz. It is perfect for extending your docking station or laptop to a monitor with amazing contrast and color depth, without reducing the resolution to get amazing details. (Connect Apple Pro Display XDR to enjoy crystal-clear 6K@60Hz video experience.) 【Designed for professional use】 Designed for the fastest transfer rates and highest video resolution, this usb4.0 extender cord has electronic safety certifications that meets all usb c standards, it built-in laser welding technology, which ensure the metal part won't break. The security of charging is guaranteed by the built-in 56KΩ resistor from over voltage or over current. 【Most Compatibility】 This Right Angle USB4 Extension Cable is not only compatible with the latest Thunderbolt 4 interface, but also perfectly backward compatible with Thunderbolt 3 devices, USB C 3.2/3.1/3.0 devices,perfectly solve the selection problem. Ideal for LG UltraFine 5K Display, Macbook Pro, iMac, iPad Pro, Apple Pro Display XDR, Windows Thunderbolt 3 Laptop & PCs like Dell XPS, HP Spectre, Thunderbolt 3 Docking Stations, Storage and Peripheral Devices. 【 Friendly Customer Service】 Every product is exhaustively tested before being sold. And we offer 18 Months manufacturer warranty and life-time friendly service support. Please feel free to contact us if you have any question, professional and prompt customer service will be offered within 24 hours.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71i+xFcxxxL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ULT-WIIQ","source_asin":"B0B299177N","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1177710","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B299177N","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B299177N","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
