window.products.push({"id":1177768,"name":"Olympus SP-550 Stylus Ultra Zoom 7 Megapixel Digital Camera","category":"electronics","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51G2XeaVgZL._AC_.jpg","description":"The Olympus SP-550 Ultra Zoom helps you capture the moment and never miss the action. Its 7.1 megapixel CCD grabs every detail and the 18x wide-angle super-telephoto zoom lens gets you closer to your subject than any other compact digital camera on the market. Pre-Capture technology works as soon as the focus is locke, archiving the picture five frames in advance. Bright Capture Technology makes it easy to shoot in low light without a flash. Sensor-Shift Image Stabilization keeps your shot steady by compensating for camera shake (ideal for shooting in low light and zooming), and Digital Image Stabilization freezes the action -- capture crisp, clear images in any situation, even at longer focal lengths. . The wide-angle lens allows more in your frame & a 100x total zoom capability is perfect for indoor shooting, landscapes and group shots. Focus Modes - iESP Auto, Spot AF, Selective AF Target, Manual Shutter Speeds - 1/2000 sec - 15 sec, Bulb Full manual exposure control ISO - Auto, High ISO Auto, 50, 100, 200, 400, 800, 1600, 3200*, 5000* (*approx. 3MP) 30 Shooting Modes, including Movie Built-in flash with Auto, Red-Eye Reduction, Fill-In, Fill-In & Red-Eye, Slow Sync modes Working Flash Range - Wide - 14.8 ft. (4.5m); Tele - 9.2 ft. (2.8m) at ISO 200; Wide - 42.3 ft. (12.9m), Tele - 26.2 ft. (8.0m) at ISO 1600 Self Timer - 12 sec./2 sec. Auto White Balance - iESP2 Auto, One-Touch, Presets (Sunlight, Overcast, Tungsten, and 3 Fluorescents) Setting Memorization - On (stores changes) / Off (restores default settings) Date/time auto-recorded on each picture (up to 2099) 20MB internal memory Memory Card - xD-Picture Card (up to 2GB) Auto-connect USB 2.0 PictBridge and DPOF direct printing Other Connectors - A/V out, DC (power) in Power Supply - 4 AA batteries, AC C-7AU adapter System Requirements - Windows 98SE, Me, 2000PRO, XP, Vista; Mac OS 9.0-9.2x, OS X 10","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51G2XeaVgZL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Olympus","source_asin":"B000RDI0PM","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1177768","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000RDI0PM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B000RDI0PM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
