window.products.push({"id":1177807,"name":"Stereo Audio Booster with Volume Control + 20dB Gain","category":"electronics","retail price":46.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41jv45EVImS._SL1000_.jpg","description":"High-Gain Stereo Amp/Preamp With 20dB Gain + Volume Controller This mini compact stereo amplifier is designed to boost the output of virtually any line level audio source such as TV audio, video games, MP3 players, iPod etc with additional 20 dB boost. This amplifier supports connection with all different type of audio source equipments that output in RCA L/R, 3.5mm stereo mini type or 5-Pin DIN type. The boost level or volume control is easily and manually adjustable from the rotary dial on the front panel. This high-gain low-noise amp/pre-amp is ideal for both home and professional studio, computer multimedia production, karaoke and mixer application. Line Level Source Matching For Optimum Performance This mini amp provides users with an excellent solution for matching the sonic level from iPod, MP3/MP4, iPad, Tablet, CD player and mobile devices with Hi-Fi system, audio receiver, computer, loud speakers. Adjustable Gain Control For Long Cable Run This mini amplifier provides up to 20dB boost for audio signal to be transmitted over long cable wire without loss of quality and overcome signal level losses caused the cabling. External Volume Controller This unit can also be used to provide an external way of volume control for any audio source device or stereo amplifier that has no output level or volume adjustment of its own. A volume control dial for variable line level output is located on the front panel. Multiple Audio Inputs This rugged compact stereo preamp/amplifier is featured with multiple audio inputs for connection with multiple audio sources: RCA stereo L/R x 1 RCA stereo L/R x 1 Auxiliary 3.5mm min stereo Input x 1[Note: This 3.5mm input on front panel will disable the stereo RCA L/R input from the back when used) Auxiliary 3.5mm min stereo Input x 1[ Note: This 3.5mm input on front panel will disable the stereo RCA L/R input from the back when used) Aux 5- DIN input x 1 Aux 5- DIN input x 1","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41jv45EVImS._SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Generic","source_asin":"B018ILAA2K","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1177807","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B018ILAA2K","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B018ILAA2K","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
