window.products.push({"id":1177913,"name":"Polaroid WiFi Wireless 3x4 Portable Mobile Photo Printer (Blue) with LCD Touch Screen, Compatible w/ iOS & Android","category":"electronics","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81dxnMXrtdL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Moments become memories—with just a POP! Giving your instant photos a ‘shake, shake, shake’ was all part of the magic, right? In hindsight, the ritual resulted in blurry blobs of color, and more photography ‘fails’ than ‘wins. ’ Now, you can enjoy perfect color pictures faster and easier than before with the Polaroid POP Instant Print Camera. This palm-sized gadget is one part contemporary, one part classic, delivering gorgeous 3. 5” x 4. 25” photos with the iconic Polaroid border. Say goodbye to slow shutter speed, and stop flapping your pics only to find a fuzzy outcome. Finally, it’s digital ease and 15-megapixel detail you have to print to believe! The camera may look like a cool little toy, but it boasts a ton of techie features designed for the digital age. In addition to awesome ZINK Zero Ink technology, HD video lets you film live GIFs, record sound, listen back, and save on a microSD card up to 128GB. Use the 3. 97” viewfinder and touchscreen display to add filters, borders, captions and stickers to your snaps before printing instantly. From Wi-Fi connectivity and built-in flash to digital zoom and photobooth mode, the new POP makes anything possible!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81dxnMXrtdL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Zink","source_asin":"B07SSD5MV3","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1177913","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07SSD5MV3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B07SSD5MV3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
