window.products.push({"id":1177965,"name":"AKWOX 9-Key Cherry MX Switch Tester, Keycap Puller, Keyboard Keycap, O-Ring Sampler Tester Kit","category":"electronics","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61g8Yywh3CL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Don't know which Cherry switch fits you the most? Purchase this tester and try yourself before you chose keyboard! Our kit is designed to simulate the actual feeling on a real cherry mx switch mechanical keyboard by mounting all the actual switches on a special design model! Includeds 9 clear keycaps, Cherry MX switch types, and sound dampening O-rings. -Cherry MX Red. Low actuation force, silent, smooth. The most popular switch for gaming, it has the lowest force required to hold the key down (just imagine how long you hold \"w\" to move forward in most games, this key won't tire your hand). One of the most popular keys, used in many gaming keyboards. -Cherry MX Black. High actuation force, silent, smooth. Basically a slightly more resistant red, a matter of personal preference. -Cherry MX Blue. Medium actuation force, clicky, loud. Very popular for typists who don't mind annoying their neighbors. -Cherry MX Brown. Low actuation force, quiet tactile bump. Can be viewed as a compromise between the Red and Blue, typists generally prefer the tactile \"bump\" feeling, yet the key is quiet so it won't annoy your neighbors. One of the most common key types, as it is used by both gamers and typists. -Cherry MX Green. Tactile & Clicky 80g actuation force - Firm tactile and clicky switch. -Cherry MX Gray-brown. Firm Linear 60g actuation force - Tactile bump, no click. -Cherry MX Silver. Soft linear 45g actuation force - Smooth and No tactile bump. -Cherry MX clear. Tactile 55g actuation force - Tactile bump, no click. -Cherry MX white. Tactile & Clicky 65g actuation force - Tactile and lighter click switch. Each sampler kit are mounted on acrylic base and includes: * Translucent clear keycaps (Qty: 9) * Cherry MX switch types (Qty:9)  * Sound dampening rubber o-ring (Qty: 9)* Keycap Puller (Qty:1)","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61g8Yywh3CL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"AKWOX","source_asin":"B01GZHU1EG","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1177965","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01GZHU1EG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B01GZHU1EG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1177966,"name":"Kingston ValueRAM 2GB 667MHz DDR2 Non-ECC CL5 DIMM Desktop Memory","category":"electronics","retail price":14.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41lYXKnqZmL._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description Kingston is the industry leader in PC memory. Designed with the whitebox user and system integrator in mind, Kingston ValueRAM products are engineered to meet industry standard specifications and rigorously tested to ensure quality. Kingston ValueRAM is ideal for those who purchase memory by spec and are looking for competitvely priced generic memory. Product is backed by a lifetime warranty and free technical support. Included in the package is one 2GB double-sided module of 667MHz DDR2 memory. Specs are standard Non-ECC, 240-pin unbuffered DIMM. From the Manufacturer Kingston ValueRAM Desktop and Notebook Memory Kingston offers extremely reliable, high-performance desktop memory and sells more notebook upgrade memory than anyone in the world. Every module is customized and tested to meet the exact specification requirements of each system. Kingston uses only the most reliable and respected components in the industry to ensure maximum performance and legendary Kingston reliability. Every module undergoes Kingston's rigorous quality assurance process   Lifetime warranty, free 24/7 tech support and legendary Kingston reliability Kingston ValueRAM Desktop/Laptop Memory is industry-standard memory designed for customers who purchase memory by specification. From component qualification and manufacturing to quality assurance monitoring, Kingston ValueRAM solutions inherit Kingston's widely recognized expertise in creating high-quality memory modules. Every module undergoes Kingston's rigorous quality assurance process and every cell on every chip on every module is fully tested and verified to be defect-free. Why Choose Kingston? Kingston Technology Company, Inc., offers a wide range of computer memory and Flash products plus all the services to support your memory needs. Founded in 1987, Kingston is committed to providing its customers with the best memory products for the latest and most requested technologies. When you order Kingston memory, you get quality components, engineering expertise, 100-percent testing, free 24/7 technical support, and a lifetime warranty. Best of all, Kingston memory is backed by the legendary reliability that has made the company the world's independent memory leader. DRAM Advantage All incoming DRAM chips are scrutinized to ensure that only premium, qualified and tested DRAM is accepted into the manufacturing process. When you buy ValueRAM, you benefit from the relationships Kingston has developed over the years with multiple DRAM chip manufacturers. As a leading DRAM buyer, Kingston receives excellent supplier support, which results in outstanding availability for customers and gives Kingston the unique distinction of offering a wide variety of memory. Lifetime Warranty All Kingston memory products are backed by a lifetime warranty, free technical support and legendary Kingston reliability. Which Kingston Memory Device is Right for You?","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41lYXKnqZmL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Kingston","source_asin":"B0037Z7BP2","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1177966","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0037Z7BP2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B0037Z7BP2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
